l you that's nowhere near enough but  there is one area where there might be a  concession between the government and  campaigners and that's flexible working  the government says it's Consulting on  making it a right for all employees to  request flexible working  and that will be one small step towards  helping struggling families like Amy's  oh she's Joshi Sky News in central  London
 

